"Mats Palmgren \u003cmats@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 1143299 - Make frame insertion methods deal with aPrevFrame being on an overflow list. r=roc, a=bkerensa", "files": ["layout/generic/nsBlockFrame.cpp", "layout/generic/nsBlockFrame.h", "layout/generic/nsContainerFrame.cpp", "layout/tables/nsTableFrame.cpp", "layout/tables/nsTableRowFrame.cpp", "layout/tables/nsTableRowGroupFrame.cpp"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "ce44e02200c4707d536461a676b76f46f04e840f", "parents": ["78a027d9596f99fb1f090370e01718ca5e62569a"], "tags": []}], "date": 1429063973, "git_changesets": [null, null], "user": "ryanvm@gmail.com"}, "257": {"changesets": [{"author": "Mats Palmgren \u003cmats@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 1153478 - Part 1: Add nsInlineFrame::StealFrame and make it deal with being called on the wrong parent for aChild (due to lazy reparenting). r=roc, a=sledru", "files": ["layout/generic/nsContainerFrame.cpp", "layout/generic/nsInlineFrame.cpp", "layout/generic/nsInlineFrame.h"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "a9ef6f87e1ad1b9c27a8e4577398ec0c0c617e71", "parents": ["ce44e02200c4707d536461a676b76f46f04e840f"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Mats Palmgren \u003cmats@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 1153478 - Part 2: Remove useless assertions. r=roc, a=sledru", "files": ["layout/generic/nsContainerFrame.cpp", "layout/generic/nsInlineFrame.cpp"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "85917067a8d5591f82d7edb46e48453b385648a8", "parents": ["a9ef6f87e1ad1b9c27a8e4577398ec0c0c617e71"], "tags": []}], "date": 1429300255, "git_changesets": [null, null], "user": "ryanvm@gmail.com"}, "258": {"changesets": [{"author": "ffxbld", "branch": "default", "desc": "No bug, Automated HSTS preload list update from host bld-linux64-spot-1009 - a=hsts-update", "files": ["security/manager/boot/src/nsSTSPreloadList.errors", "security/manager/boot/src/nsSTSPreloadList.inc"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "9b3d9808f5e4139fd176e8805d37c1a167520552", "parents": ["85917067a8d5591f82d7edb46e48453b385648a8"], "tags": []}], "date": 1429352294, "git_changesets": [null], "user": "ffxbld"}, "259": {"changesets": [{"author": "ffxbld", "branch": "default", "desc": "No bug, Automated HSTS preload list update from host bld-linux64-spot-109 - a=hsts-update", "files": ["security/manager/boot/src/nsSTSPreloadList.errors", "security/manager/boot/src/nsSTSPreloadList.inc"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "ac9794c078ffa0f01019b6c1563f1def3b8c1a01", "parents": ["9b3d9808f5e4139fd176e8805d37c1a167520552"], "tags": []}], "date": 1429957147, "git_changesets": [null], "user": "ffxbld"}, "260": {"changesets": [{"author": "Eric Rahm \u003cerahm@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 1140537 - Sanity check size calculations. r=peterv, a=abillings", "files": ["parser/expat/lib/xmlparse.c"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "2f3e78643f5cc49e367917cebd71ea90f7b54378", "parents": ["ac9794c078ffa0f01019b6c1563f1def3b8c1a01"], "tags": []}], "date": 1430149926, "git_changesets": [null], "user": "ryanvm@gmail.com"}, "261": {"changesets": [{"author": "Gregory Szorc \u003cgps@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 1128586 - Prefer hg.exe over hg. r=RyanVM, a=NPOTB\n\nThis is needed for compatibility with an upcoming release of\nMozillaBuild, which distributes Mercurial as a Python package, not as a\nstandalone Windows program. As a result, it introduces \"hg\" into $PATH,\nwhich \"which\" will happily prefer as the \"hg\" binary. This upsets\nsubprocess. So, we explicitly prefer \"hg.exe\" over \"hg\".\n\nWe could accomplish the same thing by calling which.whichall() and\nsorting results. But this is more code and IMO not worth the effort to\nimplement.", "files": ["tools/mercurial/hgsetup/wizard.py"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "8ab58180c92f52a2ded2a09afd594cf65f0b89ea", "parents": ["2f3e78643f5cc49e367917cebd71ea90f7b54378"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Terrence Cole \u003cterrence@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 1152177 - Make jsid and Value pre barriers symetrical. r=jonco, a=abillings", "files": ["js/src/gc/Barrier.h"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "068fedc4a117b332f09827bb0c148006a615467c", "parents": ["8ab58180c92f52a2ded2a09afd594cf65f0b89ea"], "tags": []}], "date": 1430183097, "git_changesets": [null, null], "user": "ryanvm@gmail.com"}, "262": {"changesets": [{"author": "ffxbld", "branch": "default", "desc": "No bug, Automated HSTS preload list update from host bld-linux64-spot-226 - a=hsts-update", "files": ["security/manager/boot/src/nsSTSPreloadList.errors", "security/manager/boot/src/nsSTSPreloadList.inc"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "6d40b79b67b0faabecc41d492dd281a4e56cda63", "parents": ["068fedc4a117b332f09827bb0c148006a615467c"], "tags": []}], "date": 1430561984, "git_changesets": [null], "user": "ffxbld"}, "263": {"changesets": [{"author": "ffxbld", "branch": "GECKO3170esr_2015050415_RELBRANCH", "desc": "Automated checkin: version bump for firefox 31.7.0esr release. DONTBUILD CLOSED TREE a=release", "files": ["browser/config/version.txt", "config/milestone.txt"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "b25163dd3c902513d7822e965b0855dd68a5af34", "parents": ["6d40b79b67b0faabecc41d492dd281a4e56cda63"], "tags": ["FIREFOX_31_7_0esr_BUILD1"]}, {"author": "ffxbld", "branch": "GECKO3170esr_2015050415_RELBRANCH", "desc": "Added FIREFOX_31_7_0esr_RELEASE FIREFOX_31_7_0esr_BUILD1 tag(s) for changeset b25163dd3c90. DONTBUILD CLOSED TREE a=release", "files": [".hgtags"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "9caa55f8150e3c3de49d09ef3d0c7b3f469bf26e", "parents": ["b25163dd3c902513d7822e965b0855dd68a5af34"], "tags": []}, {"author": "ffxbld", "branch": "default", "desc": "Automated checkin: version bump for firefox 31.7.0esr release. DONTBUILD CLOSED TREE a=relea